  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Disaster Risk Management (DRM) Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The USAID Disaster Risk Management (DRM) Activity will work to reduce the impact of shocks in Ethiopia by strengthening DRM planning and preparedness, improving DRM coordination, enhancing resource mobilization and management, and partnering with local organizations to provide locally led, tailored assistance to districts and regions.</narrative>
  </description>
